    "detailed_description": "<h1>Trailer music by Lukas Fretz</h1><p>Lukas Fretz \r\nsoundguybasel</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This puzzle game helps your kids develop matching and fine motor skills. Your children will just love these wonderfully hand-drawn pictures and will improve their spatial skills while having fun! \r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\n- Perfect for ages 2 - 12.\r\n- Rotation mode for greater challenge.\r\n- Many bright Watercolour puzzle images.\r\n- Colorful puzzling atmosphere.\r\n- Traditional puzzle gameplay.\r\n- Simple controls make it easy to solve picture!",
